#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This lesson uses an example algorithm (SQD) to demonstrate how classical and"
" quantum resources can be leveraged together."
msgstr ""
"Cette leçon utilise un exemple d'algorithme (SQD) pour montrer comment les "
"ressources classiques et quantiques peuvent être exploitées conjointement."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQD and SKQD"
msgstr "SQD et SKQD"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* cspell:ignore VQAsgres sinfo SBATCH ntasks cpus srun Sbatch sbatch "
"squeue subseteq Utar nocc gres Iskandar Sitdikov */}\n"
msgstr ""
"{/* cspell:ignore VQAsgres sinfo SBATCH ntasks cpus srun Sbatch sbatch "
